  "conditionAnalysis": {
    "explicit_distinct_mutagen_profile": "The reviewed claim is the explicit iztro-pinned-menh-cuc-decadal-mutagen profile. A caller selecting either earlier profile has not requested transformations, and the old response shapes must remain unchanged.",
    "accepted_T025_T030_branch_and_stem_prerequisites": "I rechecked the nested branch and stem formulas against getHoroscope, HEAVENLY_STEMS and TIGER_RULE. Twelve periods begin at natal Mệnh and Cục; parity with sex sets direction; Dần-relative physical index sets the palace stem. T025/T030 accepted bindings remain required but cannot approve this additional transformation operation.",
