    "canonical_order_loc_quyen_khoa_ky": "MUTAGEN indexes Lộc, Quyền, Khoa, Kỵ in that order. Hóa prefixes and hoa_* identifiers are declared B3 presentation mappings. No sorting or category rotation is permitted.",
    "15_exact_source_star_identity_classification_mappings": "The fifteen exact source keys and Vietnamese names agree with the canonical map: eleven principal targets and Văn Xương, Văn Khúc, Tả Phù, Hữu Bật as auxiliaries. Their B3 IDs/list mappings are adapter identities. Mậu Khoa specifically targets Hữu Bật, Nhâm Khoa Tả Phù. Do not generalize the map to arbitrary localized aliases or natal Hóa instances.",
    "existing_physical_natal_star_palace_membership": "hasHoroscopeMutagen resolves a scope palace role to an index and then reads astrolabe natal majorStars and minorStars at that physical index. It does not read decadal.stars. Inverting this membership over existing trusted B3 physical natal star locations matches the explicitly limited projection. Stored functionId/functionLabel are natal palace metadata, not rotated decade roles.",
    "unique_source_occurrence_integrity_guard_not_upstream_uniqueness_claim": "Exactly one coherent occurrence is a declared product integrity prerequisite. The source boolean membership function establishes no global uniqueness theorem. Missing, duplicate, forged or contradictory target metadata must close the entire new result rather than pick a first match; these are synthetic guard requirements, not observed negative birth charts.",
    "four_records_retained_when_palace_shared": "Four category-indexed records remain four records when locations coincide. Replay and separate arithmetic confirm 101 shared-palace periods; a set of palace IDs would lose information.",
    "closed_states_no_associations_legacy_outputs_unchanged": "Before first or after twelfth period, failed evidence, inconsistent trusted layout/stem/branch, or failed target integrity yields no associations. Under the candidate output contract integrity failure also clears selected stem and branch. No childhood fallback or thirteenth period is imported from surrounding upstream behavior.",
    "independent_valid_chart_source_comparative_fixtures": "I executed the portable generator and obtained byte-identical fixtures, then separately checked every period with Python arithmetic and a literal source-table transcription. Coverage reaches all forty cells and all fifteen targets. Physical B3 positions remain regression observations, not independent proof of the natal placement formulas. Proposed malformed-input guards still require implementation verification.",
    "no_rotated_roles_inserted_stars_or_outcome_prose": "The candidate emits physical associations only. Upstream getPalaceNames rotation, getHoroscopeStar transit objects, fliesTo/mutagedPlaces chains, and other temporal scopes are outside this claim. No outcome prose or auspicious/adverse scoring follows from this source comparison.",
    "preserve_classical_default_source_and_public_release_gates": "This is pinned modern software evidence under the receiving school compatibility identifier; it does not authenticate a classical book or activate generic classical tu_hoa_han. Default, natal formula, interpretation, public and production release gates remain closed."
